<title>UK: Petrogal cuts runs 20 pct at Sines refinery - traders.</title>
<headline>Petrogal cuts runs 20 pct at Sines refinery - traders.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Portuguese state oil company Petrogal has reduced crude oil throughput by around 20 percent at its 210,000 barrel per day (bpd) Sines refinery because of poor margins, European traders said.</p>
<p>They declined to say by how much output of each refined oil product would be affected, and the company was not immediately available for comment.</p>
<p>The traders said the 20 percent cuts had been in effect for &quot;one or two weeks&quot; but they did not say if throughputs had also been cut at the 90,000 bpd Oporto refinery.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 8167</p>
</text>
